%SIXMD 1
# @?ARGS - PRINT EACH COMMAND-LINE ARGUMENT WITH ITS INDEX

## DESCRIPTION

PRINTS EACH ARGUMENT AS INDEX, COLON, SPACE, VALUE.

USAGE IS 'ARGS [ARG ...]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/ARGS
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/ARGS.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

